---
title: "collateral_value_calculation - Weighted Collateral Value (Scallop Lend)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: collateral_value = 0
    q_init --> q_iter: for each collateral asset in obligation
    q_iter --> q_get_price: fetch price_i from x_oracle
    q_get_price --> q_get_weight: get collateral_weight_i for asset type
    q_get_weight --> q_calc: weighted_value_i = amount_i * price_i * collateral_weight_i
    q_calc --> q_accumulate: collateral_value += weighted_value_i
    q_accumulate --> q_iter: next collateral asset
    q_accumulate --> [*]: return collateral_value

    note right of q_calc
        INV-001: collateral_weight_i < 1.0 for all assets (risk discount)
        INV-002: collateral_value = sum(amount_i * price_i * collateral_weight_i)
        INV-003: collateral_value determines maximum borrowing capacity
        INV-004: changes in collateral_weight affect existing positions
    end note
